  "description": {
    "text": "Hydreigon Deck 30, a Japanese half deck released on 16 March 2012 with the Dragon Blast expansion, alongside Garchomp Deck 30 for Dragon Blade. Its 30 cards, three of them holo (Houndoom, Hydreigon and Blend Energy GRPD), include Hydreigon with its pre-evolutions Deino and Zweilous, and adding the powerful Hydreigon of Dragon Blast makes it much stronger. A deck-modification guide showed how to build a Dragon deck of one's own with the two expansions.",
    "sources": [
      {
        "title": "Pokémon Card Game official site, archived: ポケモンカードゲームBW　「サザンドラデッキ30」「ガブリアスデッキ30」",
        "url": "https://web.archive.org/web/20120207104458/http://www.pokemon-card.com/products/bw/szd_gbr.html"
      },
      {
        "title": "Wikipedia (Japanese): ポケモンカードゲームの発売タイトル一覧",
        "url": "https://ja.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E3%83%9D%E3%82%B1%E3%83%A2%E3%83%B3%E3%82%AB%E3%83%BC%E3%83%89%E3%82%B2%E3%83%BC%E3%83%A0%E3%81%AE%E7%99%BA%E5%A3%B2%E3%82%BF%E3%82%A4%E3%83%88%E3%83%AB%E4%B8%80%E8%A6%A7"
